{
 "id": "064-yesil-yandi-yuruyoruz",
 "lang": "en",
 "title": "Green Light, Let's Walk",
 "theme": "Crossing safely at the zebra crossing, traffic lights and waiting",
 "blurb": "The swings are creaking across the road, and Can's feet are itching to go! But the red man is lit up on the traffic light. With his mum and his dog Cinnamon, Can turns waiting into a game: Stop, look, listen!",
 "voiceNames": {
  "can": "Can",
  "anne": "Mum (Can's mum)",
  "tarcin": "Cinnamon (dog)"
 },
 "pages": [
  {
   "text": "On Sunday morning, Can, his mum and his dog Cinnamon were going to the park. The park was across the road, behind the corner shop. Mum had Cinnamon's lead in her hand. She stopped at the zebra crossing. “Come here, Can, next to me!” Can came pitter patter.",
   "hits": {
    "anne": {
     "say": "Come here, Can, next to me!"
    },
    "tarcin": {
     "say": "Woof woof!"
    },
    "can": {
     "say": "Pitter patter, I'm coming!"
    }
   },
   "hint": "Touch Mum!",
   "ask": "Where is Can going? What do you see on the way when you go to the park?"
  },
  {
   "text": "The swings were creaking across the road: creak, creak! Can's feet were itching to go. “Let's run!” said Can. Mum smiled softly. “Stop! Let's look at the light first.” The red man was lit up on the light.",
   "hits": {
    "can": {
     "say": "Let's run, come on!"
    },
    "anne": {
     "say": "Stop! Let's look at the light first."
    },
    "lamba": {
     "say": "Red man: Stop!"
    },
    "tarcin": {
     "say": "Woof?"
    }
   },
   "hint": "Touch the light!",
   "ask": "Which colour is lit up on the light? Why do you think his mum said, ‘Let's look at the light first’?"
  },
  {
   "text": "Can waited and waited. The red man was still lit up. Can got impatient. His feet went tap, tap on the ground. “Mum, it's taking so long!” Mum winked. “What can we do while we wait?”",
   "hits": {
    "can": {
     "say": "Oof, it's taking so long!"
    },
    "anne": {
     "say": "What can we do while we wait?"
    },
    "lamba": {
     "say": "The red man is still lit up."
    },
    "tarcin": {
     "say": "Woof!"
    }
   },
   "predict": {
    "q": "What do you think Can will do while he waits?",
    "res": "Both are good ideas! Let's see.",
    "opts": [
     {
      "l": "Count the cars"
     },
     {
      "l": "Stroke Cinnamon"
     }
    ]
   },
   "hint": "Touch Can!",
   "ask": "How is Can feeling? What do you do when waiting feels too long?"
  },
  {
   "text": "Can stroked Cinnamon. He counted the cars: one, two, three! Then Can made up a game. “Stop, look, listen!” Mum laughed: “I'll play too!” Can stopped. He looked at the light. Vroom! He listened to the car going past.",
   "hits": {
    "anne": {
